{"mapId":100419007,"appId":"1","authorId":302481124942579,"title":"再见……方块传说","cover":"https://assets.box3.fun/content/462T54yTPE7jQN4WJLWWvO91v4aPs4yrtf4Lin0qiBE.png","description":"别辞神奇代码岛\n自编程猫孕育而生，方寸代码岛屿，曾收纳无数少年的烂漫构想。指尖敲下字符，便能筑造秘境、构筑剧情，同好友联机造物，把幻想一一落地。\n如今小岛行将落幕，一行行代码皆是旧日温存。此间习得的热爱与热忱不会消散，这段闪闪发光的创作旅途，会永远封存于年少岁月里。\n为什么天空的方形没有围满？因为创作，永远不会停歇！\n愿祝神岛，一路走好，山河无恙，星河无阻！\n温馨提示：这个地图的模型属于壮观形，大家可以飞起来观看","notice":"再见……方块传说！","version":3,"publishedAt":"2026-09-13T10:53:14.715","updateAt":"2026-09-13T10:53:14.715","playHash":"3e6683bd5901cf32ad4d","onlineCount":0,"playCount":51,"favoritesCount":3,"commentCount":14,"viewCount":96,"likeCount":6,"mediaResourcesHash":["https://assets.box3.fun/content/2oXP7S5KJc0cKq3AQopMYCSfck585wQmWugEREZQAOw.png","https://assets.box3.fun/content/YwHXDl-X5K45DIEhk1siRA0nla5IXzDegSkAIa_DfjY.png","https://assets.box3.fun/content/o72GhFCplRSjthyyYQXqHE1_WU7nfHItgwjiRlO44uk.png"],"labels":[{"labelId":3,"labelName":"原创","labelKey":"original"}],"currentReleaseVersion":3,"combType":0,"weight":0,"teamable":false,"_tab":"mapOther"}